  "review": {
    "observations": [
      "All three SHIP_PORT, PLATEAU, and BEACH_HOUSE 256-tile atlases, all four batch maps, and the sixteen SHIP_PORT/PLATEAU TILEANIM_WATER rotation frames were visually reviewed with the $60-$ff text reservation intact.",
      "The animation evidence binds each tileset's source tile $14 and UpdateMovingBgTiles counter/direction semantics; reviewed palette and attribute bytes have exact linked parity across normal, debug, VC, and Phase 2 audit products.",
      "This is artifact-only content acceptance. Vermilion Dock, Route 23, Indigo Plateau, and Summer Beach House remain Yellow-presented behind the architecture-boundary fallback; no Color runtime admission is claimed."
    ],
